# Desktop: the Daily from the title, dropped at the centre until the crate overflows (59 drops on 2026-10-28; any day's seed overflows within ~70), the results; the Daily then offers an unranked replay and the Score chase lists the run.
# viewport 1366x768@1
until 300 =▶ Play
frames 150
click =Daily
until 60 One ranked run per day
frames 10
expect Not attempted yet today.
click =Start
until 300 =Drop
frames 200
repeat 6000 until Crate overflowed
  key Space 1
  frames 34
end
frames 30
save daily-results
expect Final hash
click =Back to title
until 60 =▶ Play
frames 10
click =Daily
until 60 One ranked run per day
frames 10
expect Best today:
expect Replay (unranked)
click =Back
until 60 =▶ Play
frames 10
click =Score chase
until 60 Local best runs
frames 10
expect Daily
save scores
click =Back
until 60 =▶ Play
